2	founder	Late Shri Ram Pathak	The Founding Father (1957)	A loaf of bread is a promise of life kept. We started with one oven and a mountain of faith.	{https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531123897727-8f129e1688ce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80}			t	20	2026-04-24 13:04:56.919056	{}
4	story	Our Legacy Begins	Since 1957	Started with a small bakery and big dreams, Pathak Bhandar has grown through passion, dedication, and handcrafted excellence. Every loaf and pastry carries the DNA of our founders — a commitment to purity and the joy of breaking bread together.\n\nWhat began as a single oven in a quiet neighborhood has evolved into a symbol of trust for families across generations, keeping the flame of traditional baking alive in a fast-paced world.	{https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555507036-ab1f4038808a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568254183919-78a4f43a2877?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517686469429-8bdb88b9f907?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80}			t	40	2026-04-24 13:04:56.919056	{}
5	team	The Heart of Pathak Bhandar	100+ — Master Bakers & Artisans	Our legacy is built by the hands of our incredible team. From the master artisans in our kitchens to the warm smiles at our counters, we are a family of craftspeople.|||Every hand that touches the dough here carries sixty years of pride. We aren't just making food; we're making history.	{https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568254183919-78a4f43a2877?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517686469429-8bdb88b9f907?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80}			t	50	2026-04-24 13:04:56.919056	{}
6	gallery	Where Tradition Meets Innovation	Our Kitchens	Today, Pathak Bhandar blends traditional baking with modern techniques. State-of-the-art temperature controlled fermentation alongside hand-shaping methods that haven't changed in sixty years.	{https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555507036-ab1f4038808a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568254183919-78a4f43a2877?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517686469429-8bdb88b9f907?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80,https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499636136210-6f4ee915583e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80}	Explore Our Products	/products	t	60	2026-04-24 13:04:56.919056	{}
3	founder	Mr. Vijay Pathak	Master Baker & Director	Respecting the old while embracing the new is how we carry the fire forward.	{https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583394293214-28ded15ee548?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80}			f	30	2026-04-24 13:04:56.919056	{}
