70	Naan khataie	🍪 Naan Khataie Biscuit – Classic Indian Bakery Cookie\n\nNaan Khataie ek traditional Indian biscuit hai jo maida, ghee/butter aur elaichi jaise simple ingredients se banti hai. Ye soft, crumbly aur melt-in-mouth hoti hai – taste mein mildly sweet, buttery aur halka sa cardamom flavour ke saath. Chai ke saath iska combo perfect lagta hai.\n\nIsse “Naan Khataie” isliye kehte hain kyunki ye Persian word “Naan” (bread) aur “Khatai” (sweet treat) se aaya hai – matlab ek soft, desi sweet biscuit.\n\nFresh baked, balanced sweetness aur ghar jaisa taste – ye hi Naan Khataie ki pehchaan hai.\n\nSEO Keywords:\nnaan khataie biscuit, Indian bakery cookies, tea time biscuit, best biscuit in Prayagraj, fresh baked biscuits pathak bhandar 	250.00	250grm	30	["https://pub-d90142ad48a24e7fa34c843dd4c9e960.r2.dev/products/images/70-1774648926919.jpg", "https://pub-d90142ad48a24e7fa34c843dd4c9e960.r2.dev/products/images/70-1774648927944.jpg", "https://pub-d90142ad48a24e7fa34c843dd4c9e960.r2.dev/products/images/70-1774648929058.jpg", "https://pub-d90142ad48a24e7fa34c843dd4c9e960.r2.dev/products/images/70-1774648929982.jpg"]	50	t		5.00	[]	f	2026-02-07 20:50:41.645374	[]	f	[]	\N	["Refined Wheat Flour (Maida)", "Powdered Sugar  ", "Cardamom (Elaichi)  ", "• Baking Powder / Baking Soda ", "Milk (optional, for softness)  "]	\N	\N	both	[]	[]	\N	[]	f	f	f	f	f	f	["data:image/jpeg;base64,", "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "data:image/jpeg;base64,"]
